.IX Title "guestfs-release-notes-1.26 1"
.TH guestfs-release-notes-1.26 1 2026-07-14 libguestfs-1.60.1 "Virtualization Support"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
